  _headline: "Tr\xE2nsito para por seis horas"
  _headlineEn: Traffic stands still for six hours
  _body: "Quando todos dependem do carro, qualquer imprevisto trava a cidade. Seu
    Arnaldo almo\xE7ou, jantou e desligou o tax\xEDmetro."
  _bodyEn: When everyone relies on cars, any hiccup locks up the city. Arnaldo had
    lunch, then dinner, and turned off the meter.
